stateDiagram-v2
    state check <<choice>>
    [*] --> Input
    Input --> check : validate
    check --> Accepted : score >= 80
    check --> Review : 50 <= score < 80
    check --> Input : score < 50 (retry)
    Review --> Accepted : approved
    Review --> Rejected : denied
    Accepted --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
